    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_13.10/p@175437",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CADE.\nHere’s the lord of the soil come to seize me for a stray, for entering his fee-simple without leave.—Ah, villain, thou wilt betray me and get a thousand crowns of the King by carrying my head to him; but I’ll make thee eat iron like an ostrich, and swallow my sword like a great pin, ere thou and I part.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_13.10/p@175437/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_13.10/p@175437/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 310,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2438251,
        "end": 2438595,
        "line": 88996,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap13/p@175437",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_13.10"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CADE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_13.10/p@175785",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "IDEN.\nWhy, rude companion, whatsoe’er thou be,\nI know thee not; why, then, should I betray thee?\nIs ’t not enough to break into my garden\nAnd, like a thief, to come to rob my grounds,\nClimbing my walls in spite of me the owner,\nBut thou wilt brave me with these saucy terms?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_13.10/p@175785/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_13.10/p@175785/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 46,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
